# GMS's Frost Clutch is one level and one number: the critical damage Freezing
# Crush pays per stack goes from 1% to 2%. It supersedes rather than adds --
# the fold keeps the better of two stacks, never their sum -- and the final
# damage half stays Freezing Crush's 1%. Ten levels here rather than GMS's one,
# walked evenly to that 2%.
#
# It does not pass its master level. GMS masters this at 1 and does not mark it
# for Combat Orders, so there is no level above the top for a grant to reach.
name: "Frost Clutch"
skill_order: 9
description: "Increases the effect of Freezing Crush."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE
max_level: 10
base { crit_dmg_per_freeze_stack: 0.002 }
per_level { crit_dmg_per_freeze_stack: 0.002 }
